<title>UK: Myanmar Airways names representative for Italy.</title>
<headline>Myanmar Airways names representative for Italy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Distal &amp; ITR Group has been named the Italian general sales agent of Myanmar Airways International, the national flag carrier of Myanmar (ex-Burma), said the company's general manager, Franco Pecci.</p>
<p>The Italian general sales agent has offices in Rome, Milan, Venice, Florence and Palermo.</p>
<p>Myanmar Airways International flies from Yangon (ex-Rangoon) to Bangkok, Hong Kong, Singapore and Kuala Lumpur, with a fleet of Boeing 737-300 and 737-400s.</p>
<p>-- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
